subject: (({first_name}, ))[[one more thing about your clients | still curious about your clients | love your work, one more thing | cool company, one more thing]]

{first_name|Hi there}, just checking in on the email I sent a few days ago. [[If you haven't seen it, | In case you missed it,]] here's the TL;DR.

[[I've been following {company_short|your firm} for a while. | I've followed {company_short|your firm} for a while now.]] [[I'm a college student who's constantly recruiting for co-op internships, so I resonate with the work you're doing. | As a college student, I'm always recruiting for my next co-op, so I resonate with the work you do.]]

[[I know for a fact you've got years of past clients sitting in your CRM that nobody's called in a while. | I know for a fact your CRM has years of past clients nobody has called in a while.]] [[Guess what a lot of them are probably doing right now? Hiring. | A lot of them are probably hiring right now.]] I think you're missing out on hundreds of thousands in revenue, to be frank.

I study software engineering at the University of Waterloo (top eng school in Canada). I've built internal tools for the Government of Canada (one is used by 17,000 staff) and for college research labs to automate their data work. [[So I think I know my way around tech and how to apply it in business. | So I'd say I know my way around tech and how to apply it in business.]]

I'll build you a custom lead reactivation system that tracks all your past clients and books you {offer.goal} meetings in {offer.days} days. [[It goes through your old leads and past clients you haven't talked to in a while, enriches them, and finds open opportunities ASAP. Then it reaches out across multiple platforms, personalized and in your voice and brand, to get those calls booked. | It works through your old client and lead lists, researches every contact to spot open opportunities ASAP, and reaches out on multiple platforms in your voice and brand to get those calls booked.]] [[I'm confident I'll get you results, so if I don't, you don't pay me at all. | I'm confident in the results, so if I don't deliver, you don't pay me at all.]]

[[Are you down to hop on a 30 min call {call.times}? | Are you open to a quick 30 min call {call.times}?]] I'll send you a Google Meet invite, or you can name a time that [[suits you | works]] better. Lmk.

[[Thanks, | Appreciate it,]]

William
